  m_text: "Pair Watch \u2013 Turn on and connect your smartwatch/chest strap to your
    phone.\n\nGet Hyperate ID \u2013 Log in at Hyperate\n and copy your ID (HRT-XXXXXX).\n\n\n\nEnter
    in Emotion Duel \u2013 Open Emotion Duel \u2192 Settings \u2192 Connect Smartwatch
    \u2192 paste ID \u2192 Save.\n\nStart Sync \u2013 Heart rate will stream live
